<li><h4 class="font-semibold text-primary mb-2">IV Antibiotics</h4><p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm">Broad-spectrum IV antibiotics (ampicillin-sulbactam or piperacillin-tazobactam) for moderate-severe infections. Upgraded to carbapenems or linezolid based on culture results for necrotizing infections.</p></li>
